id: energy-control
name: Energy Control
talentCategory: technique
prerequisites: Scholarship or Insight Score of 5+
description: >
  You’ve learned to rein in your ki, fine-tuning your control.
text: >
  Energy Control: You’ve learned to rein in your ki, fine-tuning your control.
  –Prerequisites: Scholarship or Insight Score of 5+
  (1)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: When using a Signature Technique or a Technical Unique Ability, reduce the Ki Point Cost by 2(T).
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: When making an Attacking Maneuver with a qualifying Signature Technique, you may spend 2(T) Ki Points to apply a rank of the Homing Advantage to that Attacking Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# Both asked in one window as a Signature Technique - or, (1), a Technical Unique Ability - is used, before it is paid for;
# each once a Round, spent where ticked (chat.mjs energyControlAsk).
# (1) Its Ki Point Cost 2(T) lower, never below nothing.
allow energyControl.cost;
# (2) 2(T) Ki for a rank of Homing more - a Technique with no Area of Effect, below its 3 ranks (chat.mjs homing).
allow energyControl.homing;
